OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a largely dry day
OL,6,Fand cloudy for the most part. Some
OL,7,Fbright or sunny spells may break
OL,8,Fthrough the cloud. Light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FIt will be a dry evening and
OL,11,Fmostly cloudy with some clear
OL,12,Fintervals. Remaining dry overnight
OL,13,Fwith some longer clear spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FIt will be another mostly
OL,17,Fcloudy and dry day with some bright or
OL,18,Fsunny spells breaking through.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
