OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FLargely cloudy skies but with some
OL,7,Fbright or sunny intervals. Staying
OL,8,Fmostly dry but the odd light shower
OL,9,Fpossible. Cooler with showers on
OL,10,FWednesday and winds strengthening.
